{
    "word": "стремглав",
    "lang_code": "ru",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "88bde7ff-d50d-3759-a25a-909c254d3e4c",
                "word": "стремглав",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6ef3ca7b-5bff-47fc-9f14-7fdf6744b27a",
                        "entry_id": "88bde7ff-d50d-3759-a25a-909c254d3e4c",
                        "tags": [
                            "canonical"
                        ],
                        "form": "стремгла́в"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f028875a-5439-3361-9ce1-b3b2d1697e44",
                        "entry_id": "88bde7ff-d50d-3759-a25a-909c254d3e4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "precipitately, very fast, headlong"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ac9cbf3-879b-4614-96eb-d681f6ffa2ba",
                                "sense_id": "f028875a-5439-3361-9ce1-b3b2d1697e44",
                                "text": "Но я уже не мог устоя́ть на ме́сте, наде́л на себя́ часы́ и бро́сился стремгла́в пока́зывать свой пода́рок Давыду.",
                                "translation": "But I could not stand still, I put on my watch and rushed headlong to show my gift to David.",
                                "english": "But I could not stand still, I put on my watch and rushed headlong to show my gift to David."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c6cdcc9d-cd63-3335-b038-bc0667c0dc67",
                        "entry_id": "88bde7ff-d50d-3759-a25a-909c254d3e4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "with the head down, headlong"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "543b1c15-f89f-4038-b01c-b1055eb01280",
                                "sense_id": "c6cdcc9d-cd63-3335-b038-bc0667c0dc67",
                                "text": "Митенька стремглав слетел с шести ступеней и убежал в клумбу."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e669eec8-df56-32b3-a6ca-a406a63fd9e9",
                "word": "стремглав",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "440b154c-68a9-3377-9382-41c5d6a4317d",
                        "entry_id": "e669eec8-df56-32b3-a6ca-a406a63fd9e9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(о движении куда-либо) очень быстро, стремительно, сломя голову, молниеносно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8aa1611-9eaf-4e9a-965e-0b20ecab8823",
                                "sense_id": "440b154c-68a9-3377-9382-41c5d6a4317d",
                                "text": "И домой стремглав бежать бросилась."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b6e22a2-8d21-42c4-9ec3-7358491bdd52",
                                "sense_id": "440b154c-68a9-3377-9382-41c5d6a4317d",
                                "text": "Но я уже не мог устоять на месте, надел на себя часы и бросился стремглав показывать свой подарок Давыду."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "525c03ff-6c8e-3c4c-8269-e86cb754198e",
                        "entry_id": "e669eec8-df56-32b3-a6ca-a406a63fd9e9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. (о падении) вниз головой"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7ee55e2-96af-4975-9b11-3397531221e4",
                                "sense_id": "525c03ff-6c8e-3c4c-8269-e86cb754198e",
                                "text": "Без разума по высоте летя, // Ты вмиг упал стремглав со горизонту, // Но колесница всё кряхтит ещё твоя."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df9c1d81-e7ef-4761-baf0-1238f6c86687",
                                "sense_id": "525c03ff-6c8e-3c4c-8269-e86cb754198e",
                                "text": "Потом эти люди с неменьшим удовольствием и страхом видели, как молодой граф, весь красный, с налитой кровью в глазах, за шиворот вытащил Митеньку, ногой и коленкой с большой ловкостью в удобное время между своих слов толкнул его под зад и закричал: «Вон! чтобы духу твоего, мерзавец, здесь не было!» Митенька стремглав слетел с шести ступеней и убежал в клумбу."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "131c567c-dbd5-4e39-9950-e73f5454395b",
                        "source_entry_id": "e669eec8-df56-32b3-a6ca-a406a63fd9e9",
                        "target_lang_word": "precipitately",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "precipitately",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac4aeeda-5f90-393c-881e-f4ee61e5e791",
                                        "entry_id": "c3c2ed6b-af6b-3c7e-bd92-a45cd29e2d34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a precipitate manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "feb3d2c7-d6b1-4327-880f-f9e24254f5cb",
                                                "sense_id": "ac4aeeda-5f90-393c-881e-f4ee61e5e791",
                                                "text": "He talked precipitately, and I did not try to stop him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f90c926-eef9-4fe0-988d-b7f0b471a53a",
                                                "sense_id": "ac4aeeda-5f90-393c-881e-f4ee61e5e791",
                                                "text": "\"That's that!\" said Mailey, folding up the paper. \"Now, Mr. Thomas Didymus, I leave you to your conclusions,\" and the enthusiast vanished out of the office as precipitately as he had entered."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ba43df3-ff50-4c33-890f-9f806f0e1fed",
                                                "sense_id": "ac4aeeda-5f90-393c-881e-f4ee61e5e791",
                                                "text": "Nawnim rushed into the bedroom so precipitately that he nearly crashed into the bed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa54592f-19ac-4314-b46e-6fa34b8d35c5",
                                                "sense_id": "ac4aeeda-5f90-393c-881e-f4ee61e5e791",
                                                "text": "Despite their pre-war pioneering work in diesel rail traction, the Germans did not precipitately dieselise their own national system as soon as post-war opportunity offered."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d6426fed-a4af-473d-9226-b0c7363f409e",
                        "source_entry_id": "e669eec8-df56-32b3-a6ca-a406a63fd9e9",
                        "target_lang_word": "headlong",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "headlong",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d9f23e5-c3fc-3c2c-bb70-8666cfbcb8ea",
                                        "entry_id": "660d565a-1c88-33ab-87cb-7f1d67c2a8d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With the head first or down."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae0bf5f1-db21-318c-9910-acdc6b638cd7",
                                        "entry_id": "660d565a-1c88-33ab-87cb-7f1d67c2a8d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With an unrestrained forward motion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "414962fe-cb57-41a8-afee-46998adadd2c",
                                                "sense_id": "ae0bf5f1-db21-318c-9910-acdc6b638cd7",
                                                "text": "Figures out today show the economy plunging headlong into recession."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ed0b921-9a69-4c05-b8a6-3215bbafed54",
                                                "sense_id": "ae0bf5f1-db21-318c-9910-acdc6b638cd7",
                                                "text": "When his eyes were clear again, he saw the monster had passed and was rushing landward. Big iron upper-works rose out of this headlong structure, and from that twin funnels projected, and spat a smoking blast shot with fire into the air. It was the torpedo-ram, Thunder Child, steaming headlong, coming to the rescue of the threatened shipping."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "891d2b1d-98d3-4a3e-b8cc-738e3f58b81f",
                                                "sense_id": "ae0bf5f1-db21-318c-9910-acdc6b638cd7",
                                                "text": "Realizing he is now boxed in on all sides, Hipper decides the only remaining card he has to play is to sell his ships as dearly as possible. The remaining German ships make a hard turn southeast, and drive headlong at the Grand Fleet. It is a brave gesture, but only eight of the ships emerge from the pall of smoke that roughly marks the original German line of advance. Two more emerge minutes later, but that is all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9ece58e-2187-4358-b488-3ed973486dab",
                                                "sense_id": "ae0bf5f1-db21-318c-9910-acdc6b638cd7",
                                                "text": "I felt deja vu as I recalled a video in which a Tesla owner slammed on the brakes after his car appeared set on crashing headlong into a construction site."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7644e21-d31a-3159-8901-53d13c1f3533",
                                        "entry_id": "660d565a-1c88-33ab-87cb-7f1d67c2a8d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rashly; precipitately; without deliberation; in haste, hastily."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "headlong",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff9fb9ab-3537-3f45-add7-dd68e555a967",
                                        "entry_id": "039e28e5-751a-3ff2-99f6-e42982f6e3e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Precipitous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b43c9389-c711-42ea-ab67-b815ef0687db",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9fb9ab-3537-3f45-add7-dd68e555a967",
                                                "text": "Their path led them past sharp cliffs, along narrow trails unknown and untrodden, past headlong boulders strewn across barren, treeless, wind-haunted heights."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4742510a-368a-38db-bacb-9eb119463f4e",
                                        "entry_id": "039e28e5-751a-3ff2-99f6-e42982f6e3e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plunging downwards head foremost."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4d06675-7a61-40d1-bc6f-18add8726080",
                                                "sense_id": "4742510a-368a-38db-bacb-9eb119463f4e",
                                                "text": "On sighting their prey, they check their flight and hurtle in a headlong dive to the sea."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3bc9699-a44a-3923-83af-3fde056aea18",
                                        "entry_id": "039e28e5-751a-3ff2-99f6-e42982f6e3e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rushing forward without restraint."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e83dd601-3f3c-4f07-9401-78fd8efabd19",
                                                "sense_id": "c3bc9699-a44a-3923-83af-3fde056aea18",
                                                "text": "Bumps, bruises, and scratches are often the result of their efforts to outstrip each other in the headlong race."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8b85d7b-1073-3bb9-a630-9fc8c37b93b9",
                                        "entry_id": "039e28e5-751a-3ff2-99f6-e42982f6e3e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Reckless; impetuous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a583990b-f868-46e7-b693-b03487081554",
                                                "sense_id": "b8b85d7b-1073-3bb9-a630-9fc8c37b93b9",
                                                "text": "“Time is up,” cried another boy, more headlong than head-monitor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "headlong",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26c348ce-f4ef-336d-9531-251ada533c4c",
                                        "entry_id": "d610ed8c-4dac-3292-a801-4da0f243401d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To precipitate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3c98896-e35d-460b-94ca-da5921f32b53",
                                                "sense_id": "26c348ce-f4ef-336d-9531-251ada533c4c",
                                                "text": "If a stranger be setting his pace and face toward some deep pit, or steep rock — such a precipice as the cliffs of Dover — how do we cry aloud to have him return ? yet in mean time forget the course of our own sinful ignorance, that headlongs us to confusion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8288fabe-8cde-4a7c-91c4-d2f6886a7b15",
                                                "sense_id": "26c348ce-f4ef-336d-9531-251ada533c4c",
                                                "text": "Carriages went up and down in endless pageant. Trolley-cars rushed by, clanging and grinding as they headlonged into the side streets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0d01b36c-fdb2-48dc-8563-3f1da02b857b",
                        "source_entry_id": "e669eec8-df56-32b3-a6ca-a406a63fd9e9",
